WEBVTT

00:10:58.996 --> 00:11:01.121
the Montford Point Marines:

00:11:01.162 --> 00:11:05.412
all three helped desegregate
the US armed forces.

00:11:05.454 --> 00:11:10.371
But unfortunately, most people
only know of the Tuskegee Airmen.

00:11:11.412 --> 00:11:16.537
We have such an opportunity
to make change.

00:11:16.579 --> 00:11:22.037
Our crews have traveled
to 413 cities and towns

00:11:22.079 --> 00:11:23.996
across the United States.

00:11:24.579 --> 00:11:29.496
Our collection is housed permanently
in the Library of Congress.

00:11:29.496 --> 00:11:30.996
Our digital archive,